msgstr "練習單 "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:9
msgid "xref:attachment$Ex2-Search-gbif.docx[Download Exercise 2] (MS Word 158 KB)."
msgstr "xref:attachment$Ex2-Search-gbif.docx[下載練習題 2] (MS Word 158 KB)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:13
msgid "Using the search features on https://www.gbif.org/[GBIF^], answer the following questions:"
msgstr "請利用 https://www.gbif.org/[GBIF^] 上的搜尋功能，回答以下問題："

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:15
msgid "What is the total number of occurrences for Thailand?"
msgstr "泰國的物種出現紀錄總數是多少？"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:16
msgid "What percentage of the data do not allow for commercial use?"
msgstr "有多少百分比的資料不允許用於商業用途？"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:17
msgid "How many fossils are there in Thailand?"
msgstr "泰國總計有多少化石紀錄？"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:18
msgid "How many records for the bee family Apidae are there in Thailand?"
msgstr "泰國境內共有多少種蜜蜂科（Apidae）的記錄？"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:19
msgid "How many of the Apidae records in Thailand have an altitude above 900m?"
msgstr "在泰國的蜜蜂科（Apidae）記錄中，有多少個地點的海拔高於 900 公尺？"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:20
msgid "How many of the resulting Apidae records with an altitude above 900m are georeferenced?"
msgstr "在海拔高於 900 公尺的蜜蜂科（Apidae）記錄中，有多少筆具有地理參考資訊？"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise2.adoc:20
msgid "How does the total number of occurrences change using GADM filter? (compare to #1)"
msgstr "使用 GADM 篩選器時，總出現次數會如何變化？（與第 1 項相比）"

